  "description": "High-performance, zero-allocation .NET library for mathematical intervals and ranges. Features type-safe range operations (intersection, union, contains, overlaps), first-class infinity support, span-based parsing, and zero-allocation interpolated string parsing. Built with modern C# using structs, spans, and records for optimal performance.",
  "id": "Intervals.NET",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-01-08T09:25:46.77Z",
